<header class="ref-head yr-head"><p class="cty-kicker">Year by year · <a href="/centuries/19th-century">19th century</a></p><h1 class="research-title">1895</h1><p class="ref-lede">1895 in world history: 30 events, 29 births, 24 deaths, 2 works, 5 states founded and 4 that came to an end. 890 recorded states existed that year.</p></header>
