<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">In the profiles</h2><ul class="yr-prof"><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/republic-of-ecuador"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Republic%20of%20Ecuador.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Republic of Ecuador</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The Liberal Revolution brings Eloy Alfaro to power</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-rwanda"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Rwanda.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Rwanda</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Kigeli IV Rwabugiri dies on campaign after decades of expansion</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/kingdom-of-ankole"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Kingdom%20of%20Ankole.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Kingdom of Ankole</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Ntare V dies; Kahaya II is installed with Nuwa Mbaguta's support</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/merina-kingdom"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Merina%20Kingdom.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Merina Kingdom</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">French troops under General Duchesne take Antananarivo</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/empire/french-west-africa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/French%20West%20Africa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>French West Africa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">A governor-general is created for France’s West African colonies at Saint-Louis</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/self-strengthening-movement"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Self-Strengthening%20Movement.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Self-Strengthening Movement</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Defeated by Japan, the Qing sign the Treaty of Shimonoseki</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/lili-uokalani"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Lili%CA%BBuokalani.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Liliʻuokalani</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Arrested after a failed royalist rebellion, she signs a document of abdication on 24 January in return for the release of her jailed supporters</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/emperor-meiji"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Emperor%20Meiji.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Emperor Meiji</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Japan annexes Taiwan after its victory in the First Sino-Japanese War</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/sun-yat-sen"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Sun%20Yat-sen.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Sun Yat-sen</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The First Guangzhou Uprising fails and Sun goes into exile</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/life/frederick-douglass"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Frederick%20Douglass.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Frederick Douglass</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Dies of a heart attack in Washington, D.C., after a meeting of the National Council of Women</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-adwa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Adwa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Adwa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Baratieri defeats Ras Mengesha Yohannes at Coatit in January, and Menelik issues a call to arms to the whole population in September</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/battle/battle-of-adwa"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Battle%20of%20Adwa.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Battle of Adwa</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">An Ethiopian vanguard destroys a small Italian unit at Amba Alagi on 7 December, and the Italians withdraw to more defensible positions in Tigray</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/movement/donghak-peasant-revolution"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Donghak%20Peasant%20Revolution.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Donghak Peasant Revolution</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">Jeon Bong-jun and three other leaders are hanged for treason on 29 March</span></li><li><a class="yr-prof-n" href="/ideology/syndicalism"><img class="pcard-logo" src="/logos/thumbs/Syndicalism.png" alt="" width="28" height="28" loading="lazy"><span>Syndicalism</span></a><span class="yr-prof-t">The French General Confederation of Labour (CGT) is formed; it advocates the general strike from the start</span></li></ul></section>
